'''Duche''' (アヒルンルン, ''Ahirunrun'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Duche
|image = E 036.png
|money drop = 400¢ - 1,580¢
|first appearance = '''SoL''': [[Chaos Lagoon|Sub-chapter 4 - Chaos Lagoon]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Costly Emigration|Sub-chapter 14 - Costly Emigration]]
}}

==Enemy==
Duche has decent HP, but his somewhat low damage and lengthy backswing make him pretty easy to stall. Therefore, Duche mainly serves as a tank to protect stronger enemies, such as [[Master A.]].

==Strategy==
Send meatshields to stall him out (which should be easy considering his low damage) while slowly stacking heavy hitters to take him down. Although Duche is pretty tanky, he's not threatening in most of his appearances.

