==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Duche
|Easter Duche|A much larger variant of Duche introduced in the [[Cats Abloom!|Spring Sprang Sprung]] event, with higher stats.
|Zuche
|A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of Duche, first appearing in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2's [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. He is a glass cannon with abnormally low health, high speed and damage and the [[Burrow|burrow]] and [[Revive|revive]] abilities.
|Casaurian Ahirujo
|A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of Duche. Hits three times per attack instead of two, with much higher stats overall and some new abilities such as [[Long Distance]] and a 5% chance to perform a [[Savage Blow]].
|Casaurian Darkjo|A stronger Casaurian Ahirujo that is [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] instead of Red and trades Savage Blows for a 5% chance to do a Toxic attack which removes 50% of cats' HP.
|Ancient Magamojoe|An even stronger Casaurian Ahirujo that's [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] instead of Red. Instead of a 5% chance for a Savage Blow, he has a 100% chance to [[Curse]] and a 50% chance to create a level 2 [[Surge Attack]] on his third hit. He also trades Freeze immunity for Knockback immunity.
|Perry Duche
|A pure Dark variant of Duche that lacks multi-hit, but has guaranteed [[Explosion]]s, medium range and piercing Omni Strikes.
}}

