==Trivia==
*Etymology (in his description) refers to the study of words and names' origins.
**In the case of his English name, Duche, it would be a portmanteau of ''duck'' and ''douche''.
**His Japanese name, Ahirunrun, is a portmanteau of ''ahiru'', meaning "duck", and ''runrun'', a mimetic word for cheerfulness. It may also be a reference to "Ahirunrun, ahirunrun," a lyric from the [[wikipedia:ja:マユミーヌ|Mayuminu]] song "[https://youtu.be/9s_VXbH8--Y Ahiru no Waltz]" made for [https://youtu.be/u5B_IMEzVLo Japanese Aflac commercials].
*The "Ranran" in his Japanese description is referenced by [[Zuche]], whose Japanese name is Chikiranran.
*He is friends with [[Chickful A]].
*He is one of the many enemies who were given [[Multi-Hit]] in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].

